    <string name="referral_description">Usiwahi kushiriki Secret Recovery Seed Phrase au private keys zako na mtu yeyote. Mtu yeyote aliye nazo anaweza kudhibiti wallet yako na kuiba mali zako. Timu ya MiMi Money haiwezi kuzirejesha kwa ajili yako.\n\n“Hifadhi Secret Recovery Seed Phrase yako mahali salama na pa faragha.”\n“Usiihifadhi mtandaoni wala kuishiriki na mtu yeyote.”\n“Usaidizi wa MiMi Money hautawahi kukuomba Secret Recovery Seed Phrase yako.”\n“Mtu yeyote anayeomba recovery phrase yako huenda anajaribu kukutapeli.”\n\nTofauti muhimu:\n\nSeed phrase / Secret Recovery Phrase = nakala kuu ya wallet yote.\nPrivate key = hudhibiti anwani moja maalum ya wallet/akaunti.\n\nMtu akipata mojawapo, anaweza kufikia kikamilifu na kuhamisha crypto assets zako.</string>
